{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["A Gold Bar is created by smelting 5 ",["l","黄金矿石","Gold Ore"]," in a ",["l","熔炉","furnace"]," with 1 ",["l","煤炭","coal"]," for fuel, or by transmuting 2 ",["l","铁锭","Iron Bars"]," into one Gold Bar. Smelting ",["l","黄金矿石","Gold Ore"]," in a furnace takes 5 in-game hours. The \"Transmute (Au)\" recipe is earned at ",["l","采矿","Mining"]," Level 7."]],["p",["A Gold Bar can be found (rarely) in the ",["l","垃圾桶","Garbage Can"]," next to the ",["l","铁匠铺","Blacksmith"],", after the player has unlocked the ",["l","熔炉","Furnace"]," blueprint. Five Gold Bars are the reward for completing the Bulletin Board. If ",["l","克林特","Clint"]," is your secret gift-giver at the ",["l","冬日星盛宴","Feast of the Winter Star"],", he may give you 5 Gold Bars."]],["p",["Gold Bars are also dropped from ",["l","灰尘精灵","Dust Sprite"],"s (0.1% chance), ",["l","鱿鱼娃","Squid Kid"],"s (5% chance), ",["l","暗影狂徒","Shadow Brute"],"s (1% chance), and ",["l","暗影萨满","Shadow Shaman"]," (1% chance). They may be dug up in ",["l","矿井","The Mines"]," at floors 41-80 (0.1% chance)."]],["p",["Gold bars are used in a variety of ",["l","打造","crafting"]," recipes and are used to upgrade ",["l","工具","tools"]," to tier 4. One Gold Bar can be sold for 250g, or 375g with the ",["l","技能","Blacksmith Profession"],"."]]]],["Tool Upgrades",2,[["p",["Gold Bars are required for the third upgrade of tools."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Cost"]},{"h":1,"v":["Ingredients"]}],[[["f","Gold_Hoe.png",48]],[["l","锄头","Gold Hoe"]],["10,000g"],[["i","(O)336","Gold Bar ×5"]]],[[["f","Gold_Pickaxe.png",48]],[["l","十字镐","Gold Pickaxe"]],["10,000g"],[["i","(O)336","Gold Bar ×5"]]],[[["f","Gold_Axe.png",48]],[["l","斧头","Gold Axe"]],["10,000g"],[["i","(O)336","Gold Bar ×5"]]],[[["f","Gold_Watering_Can.png",48]],[["l","喷壶","Gold Watering Can"]],["10,000g"],[["i","(O)336","Gold Bar ×5"]]],[[["f","Trash_Can_Gold.png",48]],[["l","垃圾桶（工具）","Gold Trash Can"]],["5,000g"],[["i","(O)336","Gold Bar ×